  )
  (text "Changes:\np41 LIGHT -> N/C\np40 GEN1 -> N/C\np39 FAN1 -> N/C\np38 GEN2 -> N/C\np36 GEN3 -> FAN4\np24 Pump3_PWM -> FAN6\np23 Hall_SW_1 -> FAN5\np22 Hall_SW_2 -> FAN1\np13 N/C -> Pump3_PWM\np7 Act_DIR -> ARM1_PWM\np6 Act_PWM -> ARM1_DIR\np5 M6_PWM -> testStripAct_3.3vSig\np4 M5_PWM -> testStrip_rOut\np3 M4_PWM -> testStrip_rIn\np2 M3_PWM -> cyclSpeed_3.3v\np1 M2_PWM -> Carousel_Potentiometer\np0 M1_PWM -> pwmExpander_INT"
    (at -52.07 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a067f29d-54ac-44f0-976e-2702ffad1c52)
  )
  (text "The connectors go out to PA-09 actuators\nGive power one way, it extends\nGive power the other way, it retracts.\nthe motor driver powers the two connectors with 12V"
    (at 165.1 270.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a66bf21c-9f1a-47db-971b-020cf737a469)
  )
  (text "Linear Actuator that moves the test strips \n	up and down\nThe signal lead uses 5V logic\n\n1.0 ms pulse commands the controller to \n	fully retract the actuator\n2.0 ms pulse signals it to fully extend\n\n\n\n\nNeeds to be worked on, actuator runs on 6v."
    (at 445.77 130.81 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ad9095e1-e111-493b-b6f0-2c1babe3b881)
  )
  (text "PTZ Connection" (at 265.43 222.25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b2f05092-3a26-497a-b620-73397bf9ad8f)
  )
  (text "Notes:\nCyclonic Separator Fans: (9CRA0412PAK03)\nInput Voltage: 12V\n\nN channel mosfets dictate when the Fans get power.\n	fan#_1/0 mosfet pwm pin\nControl the speed by adjusting the PWM duty cycle 0-100%\n	fanSpeed# is a pwm for the fan's speed controller. \n\n"
    (at 97.79 161.29 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c75fef6a-3a2a-4090-a6b2-b62e24d8e821)
